<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-final</p>
<p>group matches in the International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy</p>
<p>tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>Kenya beat Scotland on faster run rate in rain affected</p>
<p>match</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 153 all out in 48.2 overs; Scotland 37-3 in 23</p>
<p>overs</p>
<p>Denmark beat Canada by seven runs</p>
<p>Scores: Denmark 126 all out in 48.1 overs; Canada 119 all</p>
<p>out in 27.2 overs</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>Ireland beat Hong Kong by 51 runs</p>
<p>Scores:  Ireland 223-7 in 50 overs; Hong Kong 172 all out in</p>
<p>45.3 overs</p>
<p>Bangladesh beat the Netherlands on faster scoring rate in</p>
<p>rain affected match</p>
<p>Scores: Netherlands 171 in 49.5 overs; Bangladesh, set a</p>
<p>revised target of 141 in 33 overs, scored 141-7 in 31.4 overs</p>
<p>    Final standings	 Pl  W  L  NR  Pts</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p> Kenya			   3  2  0   1   5</p>
<p> Scotland			3  1  1   1   3</p>
<p> Denmark			 3  1  1   1   3</p>
<p> Canada			  3  0  2   1   1</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p> Bangladesh		    3  2  0   1   5</p>
<p> Ireland			 3  2  0   1   5</p>
<p> Hong Kong		     3  0  2   1   1</p>
<p> Netherlands		   3  0  2   1   1</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p> Kenya	v Ireland  - April 6 (reserve day April 7)</p>
<p>Bangladesh v Scotland - April 8 (reserve day April 9)</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p>April 10 (reserve day April 11)</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>April 12 (reserve day April 13)</p>
</text>
